From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 07:57:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 08/13] L1 threads: the standard library's time-left clock
 (threading._time, queue.time) is virtual; positive timeouts round up to 1 ns

Barrier/Condition.wait_for/Queue.get recomputed the time left with the real
monotonic clock while their waits were virtual: a timed-out wait was retried
forever (easypy test_synchronization_coordinator_timeout failed alone,
test_logged_condition spun on a 0 ns wait).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YAF6Dgp7MTxUYBRZseFL3V
---
